#. copy.retain.ruling
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:403
msgctxt "text:copy.retain.ruling"
msgid ""
"{value0} rules that the untaken route may remain in Dream Campus but may not "
"impersonate an official conclusion."
msgstr "{value0}裁定：未踏経路は夢境キャンパスで保存可。正式結論を名乗ってはならない。"

#. copy.retain.condition
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:404
msgctxt "text:copy.retain.condition"
msgid "Every citation must show the route actually adopted while awake on the same page."
msgstr "引用時は、覚醒時に実際採用した経路を同じ頁へ添付すること。"

#. copy.retain.dissent
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:405
msgctxt "text:copy.retain.dissent"
msgid "Reimu dissents: a route not taken cannot claim travel expenses."
msgstr "霊夢少数意見：通っていないなら旅費精算不可。"

#. copy.conditional.ruling
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:408
msgctxt "text:copy.conditional.ruling"
msgid ""
"{value0} grants dream-boundary conditional approval: teachable here, never "
"backfilled into official records."
msgstr "{value0}裁定：夢境条件付き可。教材利用可、正式学籍への逆流不可。"

#. copy.conditional.condition
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:409
msgctxt "text:copy.conditional.condition"
msgid ""
"After the bell, explain again why it was not adopted. An identical answer "
"proves you are still dreaming."
msgstr "鐘の後に不採用理由を再説明。同文なら覚醒していないものとする。"

#. copy.conditional.dissent
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:410
msgctxt "text:copy.conditional.dissent"
msgid "Aya dissents that “conditional” may be added in the extra edition's second printing."
msgstr "文少数意見：「条件付き」は号外第二版で追記可能。"

#. copy.wake.ruling
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:413
msgctxt "text:copy.wake.ruling"
msgid ""
"{value0} finds the argument suspiciously tidy and orders one waking before "
"retention is reconsidered."
msgstr "{value0}裁定：論証が整いすぎている。一度覚醒してから保存を再判断。"

#. copy.wake.condition
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:414
msgctxt "text:copy.wake.condition"
msgid ""
"If the route survives waking, add one inconsistent detail on the dream "
"transcript continuation sheet."
msgstr "覚醒後も同じ道を覚えていれば、夢学籍の続紙へ矛盾を一つ追記できる。"

#. copy.wake.dissent
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:415
msgctxt "text:copy.wake.dissent"
msgid ""
"Doremy dissents that a dream this tidy is probably an administrative form "
"and not worth an appetite."
msgstr "ドレミー少数意見：整いすぎた夢は学務様式にすぎず、食欲を使うほどではない。"

#. assignmentFragment.dream
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:204
msgctxt "text:assignmentFragment.dream"
msgid ""
"An option you did not write has resubmitted itself for full marks and asks "
"the ordinary answer for a citation."
msgstr "書かなかった選択肢が満点答案として再提出され、元の答案へ出典を要求している。"

#. governanceFragment.ordinary
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:219
msgctxt "text:governanceFragment.ordinary"
msgid "Ballot"
msgstr "投票"

#. governanceFragment.dream
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:222
msgctxt "text:governanceFragment.dream"
msgid "Passed in shadow"
msgstr "影の可決"

#. incidentFragment.ordinary
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:242
msgctxt "text:incidentFragment.ordinary"
msgid "Closure hypothesis"
msgstr "終結仮説"

#. incidentFragment.dream
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:245
msgctxt "text:incidentFragment.dream"
msgid "Official dream conclusion"
msgstr "夢の正式結論"

#. housingFragment.title
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:262
msgctxt "text:housingFragment.title"
msgid "Declined room"
msgstr "断った部屋"

#. housingFragment.ordinary
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:264
msgctxt "text:housingFragment.ordinary"
msgid "Offer declined"
msgstr "辞退済み"

#. housingFragment.dream
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:266
msgctxt "text:housingFragment.dream"
msgid " says you failed to come home last night."
msgstr "は昨夜あなたが帰らなかったと言う。"

#. courseFragment.ordinary
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:281
msgctxt "text:courseFragment.ordinary"
msgid "Dropped from the ordinary timetable."
msgstr "通常時間割から履修取消。"

#. courseFragment.dream
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:282
msgctxt "text:courseFragment.dream"
msgid ""
"Automatically enrolled in ninth period. The room is “behind the original "
"room”; only the roll knows the instructor."
msgstr "第九時限へ自動登録。教室は「元の場所の裏」、担当は出席簿だけが知っている。"

#. unusedRouteFragment.title
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:292
msgctxt "text:unusedRouteFragment.title"
msgid "Route deliberately not taken"
msgstr "採用しなかった経路"

#. unusedRouteFragment.dream
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:295
msgctxt "text:unusedRouteFragment.dream"
msgid ""
"The unused route becomes the primary text for BND-∞ and asks the official "
"project to cite why it was not adopted."
msgstr "未踏経路はBND-∞の主教材として採用され、正式研究へ「自分を採用しなかった理由」の引用を要求した。"

#. libraryFragment.ordinary
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:312
msgctxt "text:libraryFragment.ordinary"
msgid "Returned in the ordinary library record."
msgstr "通常図書館の記録では返却済み。"

#. libraryFragment.dream
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:313
msgctxt "text:libraryFragment.dream"
msgid "The book denies the loan and says it was the party that returned you."
msgstr "本は貸出自体を否認し、あなたを返却した側だと主張している。"

#. posts.phantasm-ninth-period-rumour.author
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:481
msgctxt "text:posts.phantasm-ninth-period-rumour.author"
msgid "North Stair Roll Keeper (unregistered)"
msgstr "北階段の点呼係（未登録）"

#. posts.phantasm-ninth-period-rumour.title
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:482
msgctxt "text:posts.phantasm-ninth-period-rumour.title"
msgid "Does anyone know the ninth-period room?"
msgstr "第九時限の教室を知っている人？"

#. posts.phantasm-ninth-period-rumour.body
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:484
msgctxt "text:posts.phantasm-ninth-period-rumour.body"
msgid ""
"It is not on the timetable, but descending the north stair adds a "
"fourth-floor roll. If it is a typo, why is a different name absent each "
"week?"
msgstr "時間割にはないのに、北階段を下ると四階の出席簿だけ増える。誤植なら、なぜ毎週違う名前が欠席なのか。"

#. phantasmCommunityPosts.0.author
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:496
msgctxt "text:phantasmCommunityPosts.0.author"
msgid "Reverse-Side Exams Clerk (absent from front)"
msgstr "試験机の裏面係（表には不在）"

#. phantasmCommunityPosts.0.title
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:497
msgctxt "text:phantasmCommunityPosts.0.title"
msgid "Is there really a PHANTASM paper behind EXTRA?"
msgstr "EXTRAの裏にPHANTASM問題があるって本当？"

#. phantasmCommunityPosts.0.body
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:499
msgctxt "text:phantasmCommunityPosts.0.body"
msgid ""
"Hold an EXTRA submission seal to the light and it reads nine questions, 150 "
"marks. Exams calls it an ink stain, although the stain warns in three "
"languages not to enter the score officially."
msgstr "EXTRA提出印を灯りへ透かすと、九問・百五十点と読める。試験係はインク染みだと言うが、染みが『正式成績へ転記不可』と三言語で注意している。"

#. phantasmCommunityPosts.0.body
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:500
msgctxt "text:phantasmCommunityPosts.0.body.2"
msgid ""
"The first candidate to ask received an unsigned slip: 'Finish EXTRA first.' "
"Asked again, the slip denied being the first answer."
msgstr "最初に尋ねた受験者は「まずEXTRAを終えよ」という無署名紙片を受け取った。二度目に尋ねると、紙片は自分が最初の返答ではないと主張した。"

#. phantasmCommunityPosts.0.author
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:512
msgctxt "text:phantasmCommunityPosts.0.author.2"
msgid "Bunbunmaru Ninth Edition (no first edition)"
msgstr "文々。第九版（初版なし）"

#. phantasmCommunityPosts.0.title
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:513
msgctxt "text:phantasmCommunityPosts.0.title.2"
msgid "Correction: dream transcripts do not exist, but can be printed"
msgstr "訂正：夢学籍は存在しないが、印刷は可能"

#. assignmentFragment.ordinary
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:203
msgctxt "text:assignmentFragment.ordinary"
msgid "The submitted answer remains {value0} in the ordinary record."
msgstr "提出済み答案は {value0} として保存された。"

#. posts.phantasm-ninth-period-rumour.body
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:485
msgctxt "text:posts.phantasm-ninth-period-rumour.body.2"
msgid "{value0} seals showed through the roll. Academic Affairs returned only its front side."
msgstr "点呼簿の裏から印が{value0}個透けた。学務へ持参したら、表だけ返された。"

#. phantasmCommunityPosts.0.body
#: src/js/phantasm-model.js:514
msgctxt "text:phantasmCommunityPosts.0.body.3"
msgid ""
"{value0} is absent from the official registry yet used one full sheet of "
"paper. The university answered only that it “does not exist.”"
msgstr "{value0}は正式学籍へ入っていない。にもかかわらず紙面を一頁使ったため、大学は「存在しない」とだけ回答した。"
